    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "The scandal surrounding Kim Soo-hyun has delivered a devastating blow to a public figure's livelihood and dignity, halting his endorsements and public appearances since early 2025. This professional and reputational impact stems from a rumor spreader who exploited a celebrity's reputation for profit by fabricating evidence targeting a minor's story. The fabricated allegations, involving AI-generated content and digital manipulation, caused severe harm to the actor's career.",
