      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.95
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "To address the alleged method of spreading claims, the police force in Seoul took protective action by securing an arrest warrant. This law enforcement action followed the use of AI-generated content and digital manipulation to create fabrication of evidence. The consequence of this scandal was that the rumor spreader was arrested, providing a measure of accountability for the reputational damage inflicted on a public figure.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
        "fragments": [
          "how-0",
