      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "In Seoul, a content creator was held accountable for the harm caused after law enforcement stepped in to take protective action. The individual had spread misinformation using fabricated chat screenshots and AI-generated audio to make false claims about a celebrity. This arrest follows the law enforcement agency securing an arrest warrant as part of a legal procedure, aiming to provide shelter from the damage of deceptive practice.",
